WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.177 --> 00:00:01.639
- Uh, what makes me laugh?

00:00:01.639 --> 00:00:02.476
- Funny stuff.

00:00:02.476 --> 00:00:04.171
- Uh, fart jokes make me laugh.

00:00:04.171 --> 00:00:07.874
(upbeat music)

00:00:07.874 --> 00:00:08.896
- People, other people.

00:00:08.896 --> 00:00:10.335
We like laughing at other people.

00:00:10.335 --> 00:00:11.999
- Other people's despair.

00:00:14.469 --> 00:00:16.094
- People laugh at me,

00:00:16.094 --> 00:00:18.335
and people laugh with him.

00:00:18.335 --> 00:00:20.609
- (laughs) Definitely, Malory.

00:00:20.609 --> 00:00:21.781
- Yes.

00:00:21.781 --> 00:00:23.070
- Do you think you're funnier than me?

00:00:23.070 --> 00:00:24.383
- I never thought about it.

00:00:24.383 --> 00:00:27.260
- Let's not like drive this
wedge between us right now.

00:00:27.260 --> 00:00:30.025
Like we're both funny, period.

00:00:32.725 --> 00:00:35.085
- You're so serious.

00:00:35.085 --> 00:00:36.502
Stop.

00:00:36.502 --> 00:00:37.989
- Oh my God.

00:00:37.989 --> 00:00:39.579
(exhales forcefully)

00:00:39.579 --> 00:00:41.483
- I have no idea what I'm gonna do.

00:00:41.483 --> 00:00:43.839
(clucks like a chicken)

00:00:43.839 --> 00:00:44.999
- You're not gonna laugh?

00:00:44.999 --> 00:00:46.183
This really hurts me.

00:00:46.183 --> 00:00:47.867
(laughs)

00:00:47.867 --> 00:00:49.248
- Ahhhh!

00:00:49.248 --> 00:00:51.197
Did it.

00:00:51.197 --> 00:00:52.360
- Knock, knock.

00:00:52.360 --> 00:00:53.207
- Who's there?

00:00:53.207 --> 00:00:54.124
- Amos.

00:00:54.124 --> 00:00:55.657
- Amos who?

00:00:55.657 --> 00:00:57.142
- A mosquito.

00:00:57.142 --> 00:00:58.456
(laughs)

00:00:58.456 --> 00:00:59.894
Hey.

00:00:59.894 --> 00:01:01.694
- You know when you like
try to fight a fart?

00:01:01.694 --> 00:01:02.772
Ohh, that's it.

00:01:02.772 --> 00:01:04.027
(laughs)

00:01:06.817 --> 00:01:10.586
- Pa, pa, pa peanut.

00:01:10.586 --> 00:01:13.452
(vibrating voice)

00:01:13.452 --> 00:01:17.132
- Peanut (laughs)

00:01:17.132 --> 00:01:18.991
Peanut.

00:01:18.991 --> 00:01:19.653
- Pudding.

00:01:19.653 --> 00:01:20.349
Pudding?

00:01:20.349 --> 00:01:21.812
Pudding.

00:01:22.092 --> 00:01:23.704
Pudding.

00:01:23.704 --> 00:01:25.364
Pudding ah!

00:01:34.214 --> 00:01:35.769
(laughs) I can't!

00:01:36.909 --> 00:01:38.858
(blows out)

00:01:43.908 --> 00:01:45.011
- (laughs) I can't!

00:01:45.011 --> 00:01:47.112
You dance like that when
we exercise together.

00:01:51.862 --> 00:01:56.398
(snorts and laughs)

00:01:56.398 --> 00:01:59.115
- God, you look like an idiot.

00:01:59.115 --> 00:02:00.509
(laughs)

00:02:00.509 --> 00:02:02.515
I love it, you're so cute.

00:02:04.935 --> 00:02:06.487
- I think I played into your weaknesses,

00:02:06.487 --> 00:02:08.633
knowing how you would react.

00:02:08.633 --> 00:02:11.351
- I'd say the hardest part
is not making any sound.

00:02:11.351 --> 00:02:12.813
I feel like my strength in comedy

00:02:12.813 --> 00:02:14.589
is like words and wordplay.

00:02:14.589 --> 00:02:17.155
- Usually, we laugh like immediately

00:02:17.155 --> 00:02:19.257
or even before we start telling a joke.

00:02:19.257 --> 00:02:21.067
- I mean, I was basically just laughing

00:02:21.067 --> 00:02:22.507
to make him feel better.

00:02:22.507 --> 00:02:23.713
So I don't think that's fair.

00:02:23.713 --> 00:02:25.664
- The hardest part was being unprepared.

00:02:25.664 --> 00:02:27.024
- I feel like I can be a funny person,

00:02:27.024 --> 00:02:30.402
but it's really hard to be
funny without any kind of like--

00:02:30.402 --> 00:02:32.282
- Someone to talk to.
[Guy] stimulant.

00:02:32.282 --> 00:02:34.545
- It's probably the hardest
day I've had in a while.

00:02:34.545 --> 00:02:36.395
(laughs)

00:02:36.395 --> 00:02:40.604
(upbeat music)

